OL,3,GNEWSASummer camp abuser has sentence
OL,4,Aappeal rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe judges dismissed that the overall
OL,7,Fsentence was too long and rejected that
OL,8,FRuben's sentencing judge had not
OL,9,Fproperly considered his "remorse".
